The unmodified Quran corpus and surah metadata were retrieved from
https://github.com/edriso/learn-tajweed (2026-09-05).
Upstream surah-name metadata credits the Quran.com API.
The corpus itself matches the upstream pinned Tanzil checksum.
The generated runtime Quran file contains selected complete verses verbatim.

Hadith: short Arabic classical narration excerpts from Sahih al-Bukhari and
Sahih Muslim, transcribed from individually cited Sunnah.com source pages and
collated against the printed critical editions hosted by al-Maktaba al-Shamela
(Sahih al-Bukhari, al-Tab'a al-Sultaniyya; Sahih Muslim, ed. Muhammad Fu'ad
Abd al-Baqi). Both source URLs, the كتاب and باب, the narrator and the
inspection date are recorded per narration in data/hadith.json. Classical
narration texts are not under copyright; no website translations, commentary,
or page markup are redistributed.

